    "family_reading": {
        "text": "NVIDIA Nemotron is a family of 5 open-weight models, all of which support reasoning and accept image and text input, producing text output. Context windows range from 131072 to 262144 tokens across the family, so long documents and multi-image prompts are within reach. Prices vary widely. Nemotron 3.5 Lightning is the cheapest at $0.06 per million input and $0.17 output, while Nemotron 3 Ultra is the most expensive at $0.5 input and $2.2 output. Output limits also differ, from 16384 tokens on Ultra to 235929 on Super and Nano. The family suits reasoning over long, image-heavy inputs where open weights matter. Limits are the text-only output, the narrow output ceiling on Ultra, and the higher cost of the Ultra tier.",
